// Monster vocabulary: every monster kind, declared as an ordered entry
// list. Each entry names the race the monster is — races live in the
// creature identity vocabulary; this table is where monster gameplay
// data grows. Load assigns each id a runtime handle in entry order;
// handles are unstable across loads (entry order decides them), so saved
// data must translate through the id mapping, never store raw handles.
[ ( monster: "giant_white_rat", race: "giant_white_rat", speed: 110 ) ]
